# Live draft counts by source and position, for mgllm's dashboard (the RATE box's drafter view) and engine-top.
# TensorFold counts drafts only as totals of finished requests (tensorfold:mtp_drafted_total, mtp_accepted_total,
# tensorfold_health:rounds_total). With --parallel, every decode round now also counts, for each stream, where its
# draft came from (dflash2, copy, none) and, for each draft position from 1, whether the draft reached it and whether
# that token was kept: /health's "drafts", and on /metrics tensorfold_health:draft_rounds_total{source},
# draft_position_drafted_total{source,position} and draft_position_accepted_total{source,position}, live since start.
# Counting only (MultiDecoder._count_drafts, called in _round after the accept loop, a few integer additions per
# stream per round): drafts, verification and replies are unchanged. mgllm, 2026-10-06.
# Tests: tests/test_9001_draft_positions.py (CPU).

